  "goodToKnow": "Der Populismus is populism, politics claiming to speak for the ordinary people against a supposedly corrupt elite. Political scientists distinguish Rechtspopulismus (right-wing) and Linkspopulismus (left-wing). In German debate, populistisch is mostly a critical label. Der Populist is a populist. Like all -ismus nouns, it's masculine. Don't confuse it with populär (popular). It has no plural."
